OL,3,GNEWSATribute to teenager killed in bike
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family has paid tribute to a teenager
OL,7,Fwho was killed in a crash on his
OL,8,Felectric motorbike.
OL,10,FMcKenzie Ratcliffe, 18, died after a
OL,11,Fcollision with a van on Waterville Road
OL,12,Fin Meadow Well, North Shields, on 19
OL,13,FAugust.
OL,15,FThe driver of the van, a man in his
OL,16,F60s, remained at the scene to assist
OL,17,FNorthumbria Police officers.
OL,19,FThe family of the teenager, who worked
OL,20,Fas an apprentice electrician, said he
OL,21,Fwas "such an amazing young man - he had
OL,22,Fhis whole life ahead of him".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
